  DTS:Description="Incremental AP invoice header extract. Regional tax treatment diverges in the source query: NA invoices carry state and local sales tax, EU invoices carry recoverable and non-recoverable VAT with a registration number, APAC invoices carry GST. Invoices sitting on an unresolved hold are excluded."
